    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/947cf10c735cb8fd0aca5cc4a965a229.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/947cf10c735cb8fd0aca5cc4a965a229.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/947cf10c735cb8fd0aca5cc4a965a229.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to embark on a thrilling adventure where every decision determines the fate of a world on the edge! In <i>Echoes of the Skyfire</i>, you'll experience epic turn-based combat, deep connections with your party companions, potential romances that will challenge your emotions, and a branching story that dares to fuse fantasy with sci-fi elements. What are you waiting for to embark on the quest for the Skyfire?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PROTAGONIST!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exiled prince, the enigmatic mage of dawn or the intrepid mercenary await you, each with a unique origin, interests and personal decisions that can be shaped by you. The path they follow will depend on your choices and will alter the course of the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/bae5f93901c6bb88dba1ae834604c434.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/bae5f93901c6bb88dba1ae834604c434.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/bae5f93901c6bb88dba1ae834604c434.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE ENLIGHTENED REALMS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a legendary world full of secrets, ancient ruins and hidden wonders. Get ready to overcome mini-games, fish, cook, brew potions and forge your own weapons. Explore every nook and cranny carefully! Who knows, you might just stumble upon a way to travel in time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee3a361c5943d86da0c8249f3cc7884d.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee3a361c5943d86da0c8249f3cc7884d.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee3a361c5943d86da0c8249f3cc7884d.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR PARTY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will be able to recruit over 15 different companions, each with their own backgrounds, classes, skills and potential for deep relationships. Your decisions will determine the direction of their stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee01c4318b31df60a21bf7be01d1cb3c.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee01c4318b31df60a21bf7be01d1cb3c.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee01c4318b31df60a21bf7be01d1cb3c.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH DEVASTATING COMBOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your party's skills to perform powerful combos that will devastate your enemies. Unlock them when you strengthen your affinity with your companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/053de9e4b130281b832a4a42e1642639.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/053de9e4b130281b832a4a42e1642639.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/053de9e4b130281b832a4a42e1642639.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/947cf10c735cb8fd0aca5cc4a965a229.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/947cf10c735cb8fd0aca5cc4a965a229.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/947cf10c735cb8fd0aca5cc4a965a229.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to embark on a thrilling adventure where every decision determines the fate of a world on the edge! In <i>Echoes of the Skyfire</i>, you'll experience epic turn-based combat, deep connections with your party companions, potential romances that will challenge your emotions, and a branching story that dares to fuse fantasy with sci-fi elements. What are you waiting for to embark on the quest for the Skyfire?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PROTAGONIST!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exiled prince, the enigmatic mage of dawn or the intrepid mercenary await you, each with a unique origin, interests and personal decisions that can be shaped by you. The path they follow will depend on your choices and will alter the course of the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/bae5f93901c6bb88dba1ae834604c434.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/bae5f93901c6bb88dba1ae834604c434.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/bae5f93901c6bb88dba1ae834604c434.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE ENLIGHTENED REALMS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a legendary world full of secrets, ancient ruins and hidden wonders. Get ready to overcome mini-games, fish, cook, brew potions and forge your own weapons. Explore every nook and cranny carefully! Who knows, you might just stumble upon a way to travel in time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee3a361c5943d86da0c8249f3cc7884d.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee3a361c5943d86da0c8249f3cc7884d.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee3a361c5943d86da0c8249f3cc7884d.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR PARTY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will be able to recruit over 15 different companions, each with their own backgrounds, classes, skills and potential for deep relationships. Your decisions will determine the direction of their stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee01c4318b31df60a21bf7be01d1cb3c.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee01c4318b31df60a21bf7be01d1cb3c.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/ee01c4318b31df60a21bf7be01d1cb3c.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH DEVASTATING COMBOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine your party's skills to perform powerful combos that will devastate your enemies. Unlock them when you strengthen your affinity with your companions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/053de9e4b130281b832a4a42e1642639.poster.avif?t=1748443045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/053de9e4b130281b832a4a42e1642639.webm?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727140/extras/053de9e4b130281b832a4a42e1642639.mp4?t=1748443045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Echoes of the Skyfire is a character-driven RPG where you choose and shape your protagonist, align with a faction, and influence relationships with your party companions, romance, and fate. Engage in epic turn-based battles, travel through time, and explore legendary kingdoms!",
